                    "script": "U+F000B U+F0000 U+F0012 U+F000D U+F0002 U+F0013 U+0020 U+F000F U+F0004 U+F0009 U+F0000 U+F0060 U+F000E U+0020 U+F000B U+F0000 U+F0012 U+F000D U+F0051 U+0020 U+F000B U+F0000 U+F0012 U+F000D U+F0002 U+F0013 U+0020 U+F0022 U+F0004 U+F000F U+F0000 U+F0060 U+F0005",
                    "roman": "Dalkir sumág dalk, dalkir khusáp",
